@Identity.Service_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080
@jwt = paste-login-token-here

POST {{Identity.Service_HostAddress}}/api/identity/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"email": "admin@example.com",
	"password": "AdminPassword123!"
}

### Use Swagger's Authorize button to paste the returned bearer token.
GET {{Identity.Service_HostAddress}}/api/identity/users
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

###
